      { t: 'Scale up and scale out', d: 'Scale up makes one server more powerful; scale out adds more servers.', m: ['scale up', 'scale out'] },
      { t: 'TCO', f: 'Total Cost of Ownership', d: 'All the costs of a system over its life: purchase, operation, maintenance and training.' }
